  "8 pictures": "8 張",
  "A 3D escape-time formula with a numerical distance estimate: the shape works alone and combines with others; slower than analytic DE.": "採用數值距離估計的 3D 逃逸時間公式：形狀可以單獨成立，也能與其他公式組合；比解析 DE 慢。",
  "A 3D escape-time formula with an analytic distance estimate: fast and robust; a good first formula.": "採用解析距離估計的 3D 逃逸時間公式：快而穩定；適合作為第一個公式。",
  "A 4D formula with an analytic distance estimate: the 4D rotation applies, and it renders fast.": "採用解析距離估計的 4D 公式：4D 旋轉起作用，而且渲染很快。",
  "A 4D formula: the fourth coordinate and the 4D rotation of the Formulas window apply; numerical DE, so it is slow.": "4D 公式：第四座標和公式視窗的 4D 旋轉會起作用；數值 DE，所以較慢。",
  "A 4d quaternion formula, one iteration:\n\nx' = x*x - y*y - z*z - w*w + Cx\ny' = 2*(y*x + z*w) + Cy\nz' = 2*(z*x + YW_multiplier*y*w) + Cz\nw' = 2*(w*x + y*z) + W_add + Cw": "四維四元數公式，一次迭代：\n\nx' = x*x - y*y - z*z - w*w + Cx\ny' = 2*(y*x + z*w) + Cy\nz' = 2*(z*x + YW_multiplier*y*w) + Cz\nw' = 2*(w*x + y*z) + W_add + Cw",
  "A Julia set takes this constant in place of each point's own.": "Julia 集以此常數取代每個點自身的值。",
  "A bulb formula as suggested by Aexion:\nhttp://www.fractalforums.com/the-3d-mandelbulb/iterating-c/\n\nAdded two options to power-rotate the Constant by the distance of the current vectors of Z and C (Cond Phi=1),\nand the following Mode options:\n(Bits of Mode value)\nBit1: Flip atan theta components\nBit2: Flip atan phi components\nBit3: Flip theta and phi\nBit4: Flip CyCz for angle calc\nBit5: Multiply powerC by the distance of vector Z and C": "Aexion 建議的球莖（bulb）公式：\nhttp://www.fractalforums.com/the-3d-mandelbulb/iterating-c/\n\n新增兩個選項，依 Z 與 C 目前向量之間的距離對常數做冪旋轉 (Cond Phi=1)，\n以及以下模式選項：\n（模式值的各位元）\nBit1：翻轉 atan theta 分量\nBit2：翻轉 atan phi 分量\nBit3：翻轉 theta 和 phi\nBit4：計算角度時翻轉 CyCz\nBit5：將 powerC 乘以向量 Z 與 C 的距離",
  "A dIFS shape: a distance-estimated solid (sphere, box, tube ...). Combine it only with other dIFS formulas; mixing it with escape-time formulas gives the error 'formula option is not valid'.": "dIFS 形狀：距離估計的實體（球、盒、管 ...）。只與其他 dIFS 公式組合；與逃逸時間公式混用會出現錯誤 'formula option is not valid'。",
  "A dIFS transformation: it bends, repeats or cuts the dIFS shapes in the slots after it.": "dIFS 變換：彎曲、重複或切割其後槽位中的 dIFS 形狀。",
  "A hybrid of a sine power 2 bulb and the amazing box, the 3d vector length decides which formula is used:\nIf it is bigger than 'Box/Bulb R threshold' the amazing box is used, else if smaller than '..threshold 2' the sine bulb,\ninbetween both formulas will be interpolated.  Make the second threshold a little smaller than the first for more smoothness.": "2 次冪正弦球莖與神奇盒子（amazing box）的混合體，由三維向量的長度決定使用哪個公式：\n如果大於 'Box/Bulb R threshold'，使用神奇盒子；如果小於 '..threshold 2'，使用正弦球莖；\n兩者之間則對兩個公式進行內插。讓第二個閾值比第一個略小，可使過渡更平滑。",
  "A last pass over the picture.": "對圖片進行的最後一道處理。",
  "A panorama all around the camera, tagged so Facebook and photo apps show it as a 360° photo.": "環繞相機一周的全景圖，並加上標記，Facebook 與照片 App 會將其顯示為 360° 照片。",
  "A relief over the surface; its size in fractal units, about a twentieth of what the view shows.": "表面上的起伏；大小以碎形單位計，約為畫面所見範圍的二十分之一。",
  "A sine integer power bulb with foldings before, like in the amazing box.": "帶有前置摺疊的正弦整數冪球莖，與神奇盒子中的相同。",
  "A transformation shows nothing alone: put a shape in slot 1 and this in slot 2, or the other way round.": "變換單獨不顯示任何東西：把形狀放在槽位 1，把它放在槽位 2，或者反過來。",
  "A transformation: it changes the point only and has no shape of its own. Use it in a slot before or between shaping formulas, never alone.": "變換：只改變點，本身沒有形狀。放在造型公式之前或之間的槽位中使用，不要單獨使用。",
