  "Tap: focus there (with depth of field on)": "點一下：對焦該處（景深開啟時）",
  "The 'Amazing Box' aka Mandbox formula, invented by TGlad at fractalforums.com.\n\nThe formula for one iteration looks like this:\n\nx = abs(x+Fold) - abs(x-Fold) - x\ny = abs(y+Fold) - abs(y-Fold) - y\nz = abs(z+Fold) - abs(z-Fold) - z\nrr = x*x + y*y + z*z\nif rr < sqr(Min_R) then m = Scale/sqr(Min_R) else\nif rr < 1 then m = Scale/rr else m = Scale\nx = x * m + Cx\ny = y * m + Cy\nz = z * m + Cz": "'Amazing Box'，又稱 Mandbox 公式，由 TGlad 在 fractalforums.com 發明。\n\n一次迭代的公式如下：\n\nx = abs(x+Fold) - abs(x-Fold) - x\ny = abs(y+Fold) - abs(y-Fold) - y\nz = abs(z+Fold) - abs(z-Fold) - z\nrr = x*x + y*y + z*z\nif rr < sqr(Min_R) then m = Scale/sqr(Min_R) else\nif rr < 1 then m = Scale/rr else m = Scale\nx = x * m + Cx\ny = y * m + Cy\nz = z * m + Cz",
  "The camera goes once around the object.": "相機繞物體轉一圈。",
  "The clipboard holds no parameters: %@": "剪貼簿中沒有參數：%@",
  "The clipboard holds no text.": "剪貼簿中沒有文字。",
  "The file's size": "檔案的尺寸",
  "The left and the right eye's pictures side by side.": "左眼與右眼的圖片並排放置。",
  "The longest side of the rendered picture. Save keeps the file's size.": "渲染圖片的最長邊。儲存時保留檔案的尺寸。",
  "The model": "模型",
  "The object in a cube around the scene's centre, as the desktop's BulbTracer traces it. More detail takes longer and makes bigger files.": "場景中心周圍立方體內的物體，依桌面版 BulbTracer 的方式追蹤。細節越多，耗時越長，檔案也越大。",
  "The picture could not be read.": "無法讀取圖片。",
  "The picture inside itself, again and again: the ring between the radii repeats inwards.": "圖片一次又一次地出現在自身之中：兩個半徑之間的圓環向內重複。",
  "The scene": "場景",
  "The scenes of the keyframes do not have this value.": "關鍵影格的場景沒有這個值。",
  "The sine bulb where arbitrary power values can be used, the calculation is slower than of integer powers.\n\nr  = sqrt(x*x + y*y + z*z)\nth = ArcTan2(y, x) * Float_power\nph = ArcSin(z/r) * Float_power\nr  = Power(r, Float_power)\nx  = r * cos(ph) * cos(th) + Cx\ny  = r * cos(ph) * sin(th) + Cy\nz  = Z_multiplier * r * sin(ph) + Cz": "可使用任意冪值的正弦球莖，計算比整數冪慢。\n\nr  = sqrt(x*x + y*y + z*z)\nth = ArcTan2(y, x) * Float_power\nph = ArcSin(z/r) * Float_power\nr  = Power(r, Float_power)\nx  = r * cos(ph) * cos(th) + Cx\ny  = r * cos(ph) * sin(th) + Cy\nz  = Z_multiplier * r * sin(ph) + Cz",
  "The triplex math sine bulb, as suggested by Daniel White and Paul Nylander.  These are fast implementions of powers of 2,3,4,5,6,7 and 8.\n\nIf you want to make an animation with smooth power changings, please use the 'Real Power' formula.": "三元數（triplex）數學正弦球莖，由 Daniel White 和 Paul Nylander 建議。這是 2、3、4、5、6、7 和 8 次冪的快速實作。\n\n如果要製作冪平滑變化的動畫，請使用 'Real Power' 公式。",
  "They join the formula list; they are also in the app's Formulas folder in the Files app. Without the desktop's compiler they run slower.": "它們會加入公式列表，也位於「檔案」App 中本 App 的 Formulas 資料夾裡。沒有桌面版的編譯器，它們執行得較慢。",
