  "stretches the space each iteration; around 2 or 3 gives the classic shape, a minus sign mirrors it, values between 1 and 1.5 melt it": "每次迭代拉伸空間；2 或 3 左右得到經典形狀，負號使其鏡像，1 到 1.5 之間會使其融化",
